    "detailed_description": "<h1>May the goddess guard you</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1736240/extras/52fab4590e6e7e3de649ab8f9ff01515.poster.avif?t=1738451397\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1736240/extras/52fab4590e6e7e3de649ab8f9ff01515.webm?t=1738451397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>Add to the wish list, please! I need it. Thank you for your support, good luck with you... ...</p></p><br><h1>Rich historical heritage and cultural background</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1736240/extras/55ce1c491e9eb3a04e571857fba6b7ef.poster.avif?t=1738451397\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1736240/extras/55ce1c491e9eb3a04e571857fba6b7ef.webm?t=1738451397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>Players can find their own story and understand the twists and turns of the kingdom's long history. The integration of various cultural elements also adds a unique charm to the game world.</p><br><h1>Vast game worlds and diverse exploration experiences</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1736240/extras/4cacbd5f73eb1c6e20a9c5919699bc6d.poster.avif?t=1738451397\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1736240/extras/4cacbd5f73eb1c6e20a9c5919699bc6d.webm?t=1738451397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>Players can freely explore this country with rich geographical environment and experience the cultural features of different regions. In various missions and events, the player's choices affect the future development of the entire world.</p><br><h1>Discover your own hero's biography</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1736240/extras/74e06c8515e3843c64cd58b10c3a85e2.poster.avif?t=1738451397\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1736240/extras/74e06c8515e3843c64cd58b10c3a85e2.webm?t=1738451397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>The story of the game will revolve around multiple heroes, allowing players to participate in the dramatic course of history. At the same time, a large number of side quests can satisfy the player's desire to explore the game world.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players take on the role of travelers in a different world, and by sliding their fingers left and right, they embark on an adventure of life!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be cautious in your decision-making and be prepared to face the consequences. In this world filled with magic, knights, and mysterious creatures, the protagonist must solve the puzzles of crossing over and survive in this unfamiliar era through wisdom and courage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Resource Management: Players need to manage resources, including combat power, stamina, reputation, and money. The acquisition and use of resources will directly affect the player's survival ability and adventure progress. It is important to maintain balance, otherwise, they may fall into madness or run out of resources to use.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set out, traveler! Wishing you a wonderful adventure!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players take on the role of travelers in a different world, and by sliding their fingers left and right, they embark on an adventure of life!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be cautious in your decision-making and be prepared to face the consequences. In this world filled with magic, knights, and mysterious creatures, the protagonist must solve the puzzles of crossing over and survive in this unfamiliar era through wisdom and courage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Resource Management: Players need to manage resources, including combat power, stamina, reputation, and money. The acquisition and use of resources will directly affect the player's survival ability and adventure progress. It is important to maintain balance, otherwise, they may fall into madness or run out of resources to use.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set out, traveler! Wishing you a wonderful adventure!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Is the world ravaged by demon armies, depopulated, disordered royalty, missing gods, saved or destroyed? Over to you, alien traveler ~ Meet the test of the world, start the adventure of life!",
